{"articleNo":"3109","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=view&articleNo=3109&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"2011-2학기 대학원별 제3차 외국어 시험 면제 신청원 제출 안내","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2012.01.13","hit":"8668","attachments":[{"name":"대학원 외국어시험 면제신청원(서식).hwp","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=download&articleNo=3109&attachNo=1828"}],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<!--StartFragment-->&nbsp;\n<p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 140%\" class=\"HStyle0\"></p>\n<table style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: medium none; BORDER-LEFT: medium none; BORDER-COLLAPSE: collapse; BORDER-TOP: medium none; BORDER-RIGHT: medium none\" border=\"1\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" align=\"center\">\n    <tbody>\n        <tr>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 1.4pt double; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 1.4pt double; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 1.4pt double; BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 1.4pt double; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt\" bgcolor=\"#ccffff\" height=\"88\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"496\">\n            <p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 14pt\"><strong>2011-2학기 대학원(일반 및 컨설팅) </strong></span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 14pt\"><strong>제3차<br>외국어시험 면제 신청 안내 </strong></span></p>\n            </td>\n        </tr>\n    </tbody>\n</table>\n<p></p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;돋움&quot;\"><br></span></p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;돋움&quot;\"><br></span></p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;돋움&quot;\"><br></span></p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><font size=\"3\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;돋움&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: 0.4pt\">1. 신청자격 : </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;돋움&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: 0.4pt\">2학기 이상 등록한 대학원 석ㆍ박사과정 재학생 및<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;컨설팅대학원 석사과정 재학생</span></font></p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;돋움&quot;\"><font size=\"3\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</font></span></p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;돋움&quot;\"><br><font size=\"3\"></font></span></p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;돋움&quot;\"><font size=\"3\">2. 제출서류 </font></span></p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;돋움&quot;\"><font size=\"3\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;▶ 면제신청원 1부, 면제관련 증빙서류(사본) 1부 첨부 </font></span></p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;돋움&quot;\"><br><font size=\"3\"></font></span></p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;돋움&quot;\"><br><font size=\"3\"></font></span></p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;돋움&quot;\"><font size=\"3\">3. 외국어시험 면제요건 </font></span></p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;돋움&quot;\"><font size=\"3\">&nbsp;&nbsp;가. 본교 대학원 해당과정 재학 중(최근 3년이내)에 TOEIC 성적이 500점</font></span></p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;돋움&quot;\"><font size=\"3\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;(TOEFL, TEPS의 점수는 토익 500점에 상응하는 점수)이상을 취득한 자</font></span></p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;돋움&quot;\"><font size=\"3\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;※ 2010학년도 이후 박사과정 입학생은 TOEIC 성적이 550점</font></span></p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;돋움&quot;\"><font size=\"3\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;(TOEFL, TEPS의 점수는 토익 550점에 상응하는 점수)이상을 취득한 자</font></span></p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;돋움&quot;\"><br><font size=\"3\"></font></span></p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><font size=\"3\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;돋움&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;나. 본교 대학원 해당과정 </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;돋움&quot;; COLOR: #ff0000\">재학 중</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;돋움&quot;\"> 어학교육원에서 시행하는 </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;돋움&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: 0.8pt\">중급이상의 </span></font></p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><font size=\"3\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;돋움&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: 0.8pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;돋움&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: 0.8pt\">영어강좌를 40시간 이상 이수한 자</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;돋움&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: 0.8pt\"> </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;돋움&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: 0.8pt; COLOR: #ff0000\">(2011학년도 이전 입학생까지만 가능)</span></font></p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;돋움&quot;\"><br><font size=\"3\"></font></span></p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;돋움&quot;\"><br><font size=\"3\"></font></span></p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;돋움&quot;\"><font size=\"3\">4. 외국어시험 면제신청 접수기간 및 장소</font></span></p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><font size=\"3\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;돋움&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;가. 접수 기간 : </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;돋움&quot;; COLOR: #0000ff\">2012. 01. 19(목) ~ 01. 20(금) [2일간]</span></font></p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><font size=\"3\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;돋움&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;나. 접수 장소 : </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;돋움&quot;\">각 학과 종합학사행정실</span></font></p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;돋움&quot;\"><font size=\"3\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;다. 면제신청원 양식 : 첨부파일 참조</font></span></p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;돋움&quot;\"><br><font size=\"3\"></font></span></p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;돋움&quot;\"><br><font size=\"3\"></font></span></p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;돋움&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: 0.8pt\"><font size=\"3\">5. 신청 결과 발표 : 2012. 01. 27(금) 원스톱서비스</font></span></p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><font size=\"3\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;돋움&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: 0.8pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;돋움&quot;\">&nbsp;☞ 경로 : 원스톱서비스 로그인→학사관리→졸업→졸업사정자료 조회</span></font></p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;돋움&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: 0.8pt\"><br><font size=\"3\"></font></span></p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;돋움&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: 0.8pt\"><br><font size=\"3\"></font></span></p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;돋움&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: 0.8pt\"><br><font size=\"3\"></font></span></p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;돋움&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: 0.8pt\"><br><font size=\"3\"></font></span></p>\n<p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 140%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;돋움&quot;\"><font size=\"3\">2012. 01.</font></span></p>\n<p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 140%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;돋움&quot;\"><br><font size=\"3\"></font></span></p>\n<p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 140%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;돋움&quot;\"><br><font size=\"3\"></font></span></p>\n<p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 140%\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 140%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;돋움&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 16pt\"><font size=\"3\">금오공과대학교 대학원(일반 및 컨설팅)장</font></span></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
